// A record update of a value that is no record is refused. The update is
// written as the run target, which the lowering reads no final expression as
// yet (#1105), and the lowering admits no record update (#1110), so those
// refusals stand in front of it.

/// An integer.
@[ checks ]
def n = 5;

/// The integer updated as if a record (#1105, #1110).
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment.WrongSort.declaration") ]
#{ n | x = 1 }
